    "id": "tb-208-4",
    "field": "question",
    "original": "<p><i><b>‘The tarik’ (Fig c), or pulling tea, is popular in </b></i><i><b>countries like India, Malaysia and Singapore. </b></i><i><b>Suppose the tea leaves the upper jar horizontally </b></i><i><b>with a speed of 0.5 m s</b></i><i><b><sup>−1</sup></b></i><i><b>. Which of the following </b></i><i><b>are the possible horizontal distance </b></i><i><b>s</b></i><i><b><sub>x</sub></b></i><i><b> and vertical </b></i><i><b>distance </b></i><i><b>s</b></i><i><b><sub>y</sub></b></i><i><b> between the two jars so that the lower </b></i><i><b>jar can catch the tea? Neglect the sizes of the jars.</b></i></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-exercises/media/b4be626bb97d88bc57b4168f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:173.6px\"/></p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Option</b></p></td><td><p><b>sₓ / m</b></p></td><td><p><b>sᵧ / m</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>A</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.10</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.39</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>B</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.20</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.39</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>C</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.10</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.78</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>D</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.20</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.78</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "replacement": "<p><i><b>‘The tarik’ (Fig c), or pulling tea, is popular in </b></i><i><b>countries like India, Malaysia and Singapore. </b></i><i><b>Suppose the tea leaves the upper jar horizontally </b></i><i><b>with a speed of 0.5 m s</b></i><i><b><sup>−1</sup></b></i><i><b>. Which of the following </b></i><i><b>are the possible horizontal distance </b></i><i><b>s</b></i><i><b><sub>x</sub></b></i><i><b> and vertical </b></i><i><b>distance </b></i><i><b>s</b></i><i><b><sub>y</sub></b></i><i><b> between the two jars so that the lower </b></i><i><b>jar can catch the tea? Neglect the sizes of the jars.</b></i></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-exercises/media/208-4-complete-labels.png\" alt=\"Pouring tea with the full horizontal sx and vertical sy labels\" style=\"width:310px\"></p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Option</b></p></td><td><p><b>sₓ / m</b></p></td><td><p><b>sᵧ / m</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>A</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.10</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.39</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>B</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.20</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.39</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>C</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.10</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.78</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>D</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.20</b></p></td><td><p><b>0.78</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
