    "field": "question",
    "original": "<p><i><b>A transport helicopter flies horizontally at a </b></i><i><b>constant velocity of 20 m s</b></i><i><b><sup>−1</sup></b></i><i><b> at a height of </b></i><i><b>125 m (Fig o). It releases a package to a target </b></i><i><b>site on the ground.</b></i></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-exercises/media/40826cf518cd9ef20b938d88.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100.8px\"/></p><p><i><b>target site</b></i></p><p><i><b>Fig o</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(a) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>How long does it take for the package to fall </b></i><i><b>from the helicopter to the ground? </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(2 marks)</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(b) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>Find the horizontal distance of the helicopter </b></i><i><b>from the target site when the package is </b></i><i><b>released. </b></i><i><b>(2 marks)</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(c) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(i) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>The package is released at time </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b> = 0. </b></i><i><b>Express the vertical distance </b></i><i><b>d</b></i><i><b> from the </b></i><i><b>ground in terms of </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b>.</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(ii)  Sketch a graph of </b></i><i><b>d</b></i><i><b> against </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b> during the </b></i><i><b>flight of the package. </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(3 marks)</b></i></p>",
    "replacement": "<p><i><b>A transport helicopter flies horizontally at a </b></i><i><b>constant velocity of 20 m s</b></i><i><b><sup>−1</sup></b></i><i><b> at a height of </b></i><i><b>125 m (Fig o). It releases a package to a target </b></i><i><b>site on the ground.</b></i></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-exercises/media/208-17-complete-labels.png\" alt=\"Helicopter and ground target site in their original positions\" style=\"width:330px\"></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(a) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>How long does it take for the package to fall </b></i><i><b>from the helicopter to the ground? </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(2 marks)</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(b) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>Find the horizontal distance of the helicopter </b></i><i><b>from the target site when the package is </b></i><i><b>released. </b></i><i><b>(2 marks)</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(c) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(i) </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>The package is released at time </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b> = 0. </b></i><i><b>Express the vertical distance </b></i><i><b>d</b></i><i><b> from the </b></i><i><b>ground in terms of </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b>.</b></i></p><p><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(ii)  Sketch a graph of </b></i><i><b>d</b></i><i><b> against </b></i><i><b>t</b></i><i><b> during the </b></i><i><b>flight of the package. </b></i><i><b> </b></i><i><b>(3 marks)</b></i></p>",
